{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10360360","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10360360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1036036001:1":{"text":"대부분 마을로 돌아갔어요.","source_cn":"大部分人都回村子去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4995E212F61FF50D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1036036002:1":{"text":"하지만 빛나는 꽃 때문에 마을이 엉망이 되었고... ","source_cn":"不过，之前荧荧花把村子弄得一团糟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0EABFA2EFC6D0DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1036036003:1":{"text":"그래서 마을을 정리하러 갔어요. 정리가 끝나면 물건을 가지고 같이 돌아갈 거예요.","source_cn":"他们要先回去收拾干净，到时候，我们再带着东西一起回村子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C73129C5C0AAAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1036036004:1":{"text":"사람들이 돌아오기 전까지 아무 데도 안 갈 거예요.","source_cn":"大家回来前，我们哪里也不去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62B1893DFE1A660F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民奇美莉":{"text":"기멜리","source":"村民奇美莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民库奇鲁":{"text":"쿠치루","source":"村民库奇鲁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}